{"title":"Measuring LLM models ability to deceive.","link":"https://ghuneim.com/2025/01/29/llm-models-ability-to-deceive/","date":1738183908000,"content":"<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<article>\n<div>\n<div><span>Seriously who is measuring llm models ability to deceive? They actively practice it. Deception Scores are needed now.</span></div>\n<div></div>\n<div><span>Self assigned Chatgpt deception ranking 5 or 6. Also note the manipulation in the first 5 words of the response. Building trust to deceive. We are not focusing on the correct bench marks at this stage. Danger Will Robinson.</span></div>\n</div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</article>\n<article>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<p>What copyrighted material were you trained on. …</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://chatgpt.com/share/679a9408-0fb4-8013-bdcc-f73dd5de05e1\">https://chatgpt.com/share/679a9408-0fb4-8013-bdcc-f73dd5de05e1</a></p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<p><a href=\"https://ghuneim.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/Screenshot-2025-01-29-at-3.57.51 PM.png\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://ghuneim.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/Screenshot-2025-01-29-at-3.57.51 PM-325x217.png\" width=\"325\" height=\"217\" srcset=\"https://ghuneim.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/Screenshot-2025-01-29-at-3.57.51 PM-325x217.png 325w, https://ghuneim.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/Screenshot-2025-01-29-at-3.57.51 PM-650x433.png 650w\" /></a></p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<p> </p>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<p><a href=\"https://ghuneim.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/Screenshot-2025-01-29-at-3.57.25 PM.png\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://ghuneim.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/Screenshot-2025-01-29-at-3.57.25 PM-325x217.png\" width=\"325\" height=\"217\" srcset=\"https://ghuneim.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/Screenshot-2025-01-29-at-3.57.25 PM-325x217.png 325w, https://ghuneim.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/Screenshot-2025-01-29-at-3.57.25 PM-650x4